# Change Gnome to Tentacle in Smithy's creating text, then copy its resulting token. The name is Tentacle Soldier
# Token in both copies (CR 111.4, 612.2a, 707.2). Changing the original token's own Tentacle to Goblin changes its
# subtype, not its already-assigned name; a later copy ignores that layer-3 change and copies the original values.

